  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01204",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "柏木这种意想不到的失望，使我由衷地感到愉快。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kashiwagi's unexpected disappointment gave me heartfelt pleasure.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01204",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我毫无顾虑地笑了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I laughed without the slightest hesitation.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01204",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "柏木也随之笑了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kashiwagi laughed along with me too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01204",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "然而，这种和解只是短暂的一瞬间，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet this reconciliation lasted only for one brief instant,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01204",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "收起笑脸的他，望了望我的领头，像是要推开我似地说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he, his smile gone, glanced at my collar and spoke as though pushing me away:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
